    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.28,
      "text": "First, look at SMS text messaging."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.0,
      "end": 7.98,
      "text": "It was originally built strictly to send short, utilitarian messages over early mobile networks."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.58,
      "end": 11.3,
      "text": "Its creators did not expect it to be a primary feature."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.88,
      "end": 17.5,
      "text": "Instead, young users got hold of the technology and repurposed it, turning texting into a"
    },
